{"summary":"Flow Free® reimagined: Infinite possibilities!","description":"Flow Free® reimagined: Infinite possibilities!\n\nIf you like Flow Free, you'll love Flow Free: Shapes!\n\nConnect matching colors with pipe to create a Flow®. Pair all colors, and cover the entire board to solve each puzzle in Flow Free: Shapes. But watch out, pipes will break if they cross or overlap!\n\nFree play through hundreds of levels, or race against the clock in Time Trial mode. Flow Free: Shapes gameplay ranges from simple and relaxed, to challenging and frenetic, and everywhere in between. How you play is up to you. So, give Flow Free: Shapes a try, and experience \"mind like water\"!\n\nFlow Free: Shapes features:\n\n★ Over 4,000 free, shaped puzzles!\n★ Daily puzzles: new levels every day, never run out\n★ Carefully crafted, high-quality puzzles ranging from easy to extreme!\n★ Optimized touch controls for smooth, satisfying play\n★ Google Play Games achievements and cloud sync of your progress\n★ Clean, colorful graphics and fun sound effects\n\nEnjoy!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $19.99 per item","video":null,"header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8HnIwYhbNovQkDJeYgRMps95JYAEnJ8u-SzpA2Xd2YdDAUrb1-L39PlX2YEr-j-dey0Lnd1fWn9azLnspI3AMA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aloQx5wh9KK2xAIVkxhgfpuWXVJWHRn9luwJjWIPLWzp7R2lrhMedp38kPijxNi7c_p6XUuxQGIouiFKl2VgOg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Y29jzrE8hXobVoAxNyxT5gNx3jgF2Z2aaSgQGsyIPD1neDWUnmWVqhJj-lEBfrY7JTVwXoTJBwYZZpjJi-kG6w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4BVbwjFBJXwl2LqsGA1vE-3Axpw2hKaXbvbkAzj_ULCqdtNWJrR-ALLud6IKc9u8nEeUr3fcUEvgpadHi2YJXg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KV0okulh0844ieFqdT8KMV7LV_QDR8sCIcxZt_AQ5K0gCuesDCj-2pU1s3oD91NU7eoj8zA5UxH1ft9T_kygNA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rXJUWV96edhSnN_NsjL3DHtiYU68I23kqSlZuQZt2lpDIzeFkU0kuQobaBvLkCNyE4nXE7eFeWd_2S5HaujUpIk","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3JWc97ngQAMZP8S3i2xYJ5P-v8JLBby